    <img src="/assets/img/u0/u0-opvl-quadrant.svg" alt="OPVL quadrant: Origin asks who made this, when, and what kind of thing it is; Purpose asks why it exists and for whom; Value asks what it is genuinely good for answering; Limitations asks what it cannot tell you.">
  </figure>
