      <div class="choice-title">A news article on a contested topic</div>
      <div class="choice-detail">Seth Borenstein, <a href="https://apnews.com/article/ai-data-centers-environment-climate-footprint-a792f184a9f2833b5388dbae8b41ca95" target="_blank" rel="noopener">'Energy, water use and pollution of AI and data centers rival most countries'</a> (AP News, June 2026). A UN report says the infrastructure behind AI uses electricity and water at the scale of entire countries; industry voices in the same article say it's worth it. We work through OPVL on this together, including on the tools this course itself uses. Printed excerpt (about 400 words) provided in class; full article linked.</div>
    </div>
