  <div class="callout" style="margin-top: 16px;">
    <div class="callout-title">Set up your Reflection Journal (10 min, today)</div>
    <p>Every block ends with a reflection, and it lives in one place all year: your Reflection Journal. Today: (1) create a Google Doc named 'Reflection Journal - [your name] - E&amp;ES', (2) put it in your class Drive folder, (3) write your first entry, which is today's Reflect prompt. Voice-memo option: create a 'Journal audio' subfolder in the same place. This journal is where your thinking gets visible over time; some entries get revisited weeks later, so date every entry. Your journal holds two kinds of writing: your reflections, and your <a href='/foundations/notetaking/#power-notes'>Power Notes</a> from videos and readings. Your first set is today's orientation video.</p>
